    apply: "Commit to read the Bible daily for the next month, starting with a Gospel. Ask of each passage, What does this show about God? What does it ask of me? Keep a journal. Before any major decision, check what Scripture says on the subject.",
    activity: "Read 2 Timothy 3:14-17 and list the four uses of Scripture. Ask learners to give an example of each from their own experience. Then read Isaiah 8:19-20 and discuss how to test voices. Place a Bible at the centre of the circle and pray.",
